## Problem
**Not implemented.** The internal helper `__ccoshsinh` does not exist in the Rust codebase. The test binary falls back to the C version, masking the gap. This function is used internally by complex trigonometric/hyperbolic functions.

## What Needs to Change
Transpile `__ccoshsinh` from `ctrigd.c` into Rust and add it to the complexd module. Wire up the C FFI export in `lib.rs`.

## Success Criteria
